  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "<Translation: We did it. We crossed over into a new universe. Unfortunately...we are now stuck here due to a rather unfortunate problem with the Core. We will need to locate an equivalent power source in this universe in order to return. Efforts are already underway.>",
    "value": "<译文：我等成功了。我等穿越到了一个新的宇宙。但不幸的是，由于核心系统出现意外故障，我等现在被困在此处。为了返回，必须在这个宇宙中找到等效的能源。搜寻行动已经展开。>"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "<We have seeded the first Proto-World. An interesting bi-product is a new form of...dare I call it metal? It has similar properties. We have deemed it Protocite. It seems exceptionally well suited to energy transference. It should be mentioned that unlike most ore, however, our people cannot digest it. Do not eat this metal.>",
    "value": "<我等已播下第一颗原毒之种。过程中出现一种有趣的副产品，是一种新的...或许可称之为金属的物质？它具有类似特性，我等将其命名为“原析矿”。它似乎非常适合能量传导。但需要说明的是，与大多数矿石不同，我族无法消化它。切勿食用这种金属。>"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "<Should you disregard the previous warning and ingest this metal, know that it will very swiftly rework your internal biology. You will become a hollow shell of your former self, and eventually completely transform into a nameless mutant immune to the ravages of time. You will effectively become a brain-dead husk for eternity.>",
    "value": "<若你无视先前的警告而误食此金属，须知它将迅速重构你的体内生物系统。你会逐渐变成一具空壳，最终彻底转化为一种无名的变异体，不受时间侵蚀的影响。实质上，你将永远成为一具脑死亡的空骸。>"
  }
]